            <div xml:id="d644">

                <pb facs="0829" n="819" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg819"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.243/4–1147: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-04-11T18:00:00-05:00">April 11, 1947—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>427. Dept now perceives no objection to transfer (Embtel 790 Apr 11) small arms
                    and ammunition to Maritime Customs preventive service. Navy informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
